/-!
# Embedded pair fixers in the Lie alternatives

`Lie.Basic` retains the actual involution action and the component in its
fixed subgroup. `Lie.Four` proves the PSL₄(2)–A₆ fixer bound.
The field families, the linear/unitary and symplectic graph cases, and
PSL₅(2) remain separate obligations before constructing `LieBounds`.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, 16.1.7(3a–e) and 16.3.5, combined manuscript
of 1 March 2004, printed pp.1172–1173 and 1178–1179.
-/
